            "title": "Fix #{{trigger.number}}: {{trigger.title}}",
            "details": "{{steps.ask.assessment.question}} {{steps.ask.assessment.summary}}\n\nIf you say yes, the agent works on feat/issue-{{trigger.number}} in whombat/docs: for a bug, a failing test first; for another change, tests that cover it.\n\nA fresh review turn checks the work and a pull request is opened that closes the issue. Nothing is merged: that stays with a person.",
            "approverIds": [],
